Mon Oct 26 11:21:06 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.12.1 (upstream tag v0.12.1, 2026-10-25):
  * Hardening (M2.9/M6/M7): hostile XLSX imports, datetime fields,
    wildcard searches, lambda work, print/export/autofit and native
    file open/save are bounded; protection gaps closed; Agile
    encryption dataIntegrity is enforced; a self-calling LAMBDA
    answers #NUM! instead of overflowing the stack.
  * New: PivotTable Show Details, Auto Fill Options button, Fill
    Days/Weekdays/Months/Years, Show Outline Symbols (Ctrl+8),
    Paste Name (F3), richer Go To, status bar statistics menu,
    100% Stacked Area/Bar charts, Circular References submenu,
    theme tokens, multi-line formula bar and code editor widget.
  * Fixes: structured-reference '!' kept on XLSX save, accounting
    formats 42/44 written with their code, MOD with tiny divisors,
    TEXTBEFORE/TEXTAFTER empty instance_num, Ctrl+click follows
    hyperlinks, more translations (Romanian, Japanese).
  * Re-vendored (update=true); cargo_vendor lockfile audit clean
    (the cargo_audit service is a no-op). Licence set of the
    vendor tree unchanged, no new copyleft; no new system deps.
- Set the fixed metainfo release date to 2026-10-25.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Oct 23 06:53:07 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.11.1 (upstream tag v0.11.1, 2026-10-22):
  * 0.10.0 (2026-10-21) only changed CI; there was no 0.11.0.
  * Hardening: embedded scripts need workbook trust before they
    run; SUBTOTAL/AGGREGATE, LINEST, array broadcasts, pasted HTML
    colspan/rowspan, repeated XLSX columns and long dependency
    chains are bounded; the control channel drops a request whose
    sender already timed out instead of running it late.
  * Interface languages Dutch, Romanian, Greek, Italian, Polish,
    Turkish, Ukrainian and Vietnamese; Japanese dialogs translated;
    Spanish formula aliases for financial functions.
  * New: Advanced Filter dialog, fill-handle right-drag menu, Number
    Stored as Text indicator, More Colors/Recent Colors, Ctrl+[ and
    Ctrl+] select precedents/dependents, wrap-aware row auto-fit;
    PDF export keeps hyperlinks and gridcraft-cli convert writes PDF.
  * XLSX/charts: phonetic runs, per-script theme fonts, dynamic-array
    cell metadata, note boxes and header/footer pictures kept on
    save; multi-level category axes; [Content_Types].xml written
    first so libmagic detects the file type.
  * gridcraft-cli check fails on empty or incomplete input discovery
    and its --json lists warning messages instead of a count.
  * Fixes: closing the window asks to save; Ctrl+Q no longer quits
    outside macOS; CJK text prints with a CID font; Lao text uses an
    installed Lao face; many Excel-parity calculation fixes.
  * Re-vendored (update=true): only clipboard-win 5.4.3, memmap2
    0.9.12, open 5.4.5 and tokio 1.54.1 move, licences unchanged;
    of these only memmap2 is linked. Crate and licence set of the
    shipped targets unchanged, no new copyleft, tag and notice
    stand; no new system deps; MSRV still 1.90.
  * cargo_vendor lockfile audit clean, no advisories (the
    cargo_audit service is a no-op).
- Set the fixed metainfo release date to 2026-10-22; it was still
  2026-10-18 from 0.8.0.

