Wed Oct 21 06:40:33 UTC 2026 - Paolo Stivanin <info@paolostivanin.com>

- Update to 0.9.0 (upstream tag v0.9.0, 2026-10-20):
  * Pivot tables: grand totals read and written in Excel's
    direction; TRUE/FALSE or error values in a source no longer make
    the file unopenable; unknown value-field funcs rejected.
  * Right-to-left sheets kept across XLSX, XLS and HTML import and
    export; keytips and keyboard shortcuts for whole rows/columns.
  * Fixes: MEDIAN overflow, TEXTBEFORE/TEXTAFTER negative instances,
    255-character name limit counted in characters, touch panning.
  * Re-vendored; no new system deps.

