- Update to 0.8.0 (upstream tag v0.8.0, 2026-10-18):
  * Formulas: recalculate all changed cells after large-range clears;
    Excel 8,192-character limit and postfix nesting no longer crash.
  * UI: AutoFilter Enter applies and closes; control port closes on the
    first non-request line.
  * Re-vendored (update=true, lockfile moves with vendor tree: arboard
    3.7.0, combine 4.6.9, zbus/zvariant fixlets); license re-derived
    over shipped targets, no new copyleft (MPL-2.0 colored and BSL-1.0
    crates not linked), tag stands; no new system deps.

