Thu Oct 15 05:08:04 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.7.0 (upstream tag v0.7.0, 2026-10-14):
  * Calculation hardening: spill/offset/INDEX/INDIRECT overflows give #REF!,
    deep operator chains print iteratively, TEXTSPLIT/HSTACK/PIVOTBY size-checked
  * Functions match Excel 365 (MIRR/COUNTIF/ROMAN/MODE/DGET/CELL), date-system
    fixes, structured-reference spacing, defined-name quoting
  * XLS/XLSX fidelity: FORMAT truncation, compound-sector opens, calc settings,
    default font and fileVersion kept, chart sheets and XML maps survive
  * Interface: Page Setup/Validation/Zoom dialogs open on current values,
    Serbian/Czech/pt-BR translations, sheet navigator, PDF export, hyperlink
    confirmation (http/https/mailto only)
  * No CVE keywords in the 0.6.1-0.7.0 range; cargo_audit clean.
- Packaging: vendor re-audit (update=true): no new copyleft linked; tag unchanged

