Tue Oct 13 07:29:15 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.6.1 (upstream tag v0.6.1, 2026-10-12):
  * Legacy .xls (BIFF8) import and password-encrypted workbooks
    (Agile and Standard encryption); XLSX keeps unmodelled parts
    on save, writes threaded comments, checkboxes and trendlines.
  * New functions ODDFPRICE/ODDFYIELD/ODDLPRICE/ODDLYIELD,
    FORECAST.ETS family, TRIMRANGE, PERCENTOF, EUROCONVERT and
    BAHTTEXT; iterative calculation for circular references.
  * Charts: PivotCharts, Recommended Charts dialog and Select Data;
    Page Layout view with rulers and in-place headers/footers;
    table slicers, Analysis ToolPak (13 tools), Solver and
    Forecast Sheet.
  * Interface languages Spanish, German, Czech and French; File
    Backstage view, display-theme switch and print via dialog.
  * XLSX: bump quick-xml 0.38.4 to 0.41.0, fixing RUSTSEC-2026-0195
    (unbounded namespace-declaration allocation) and RUSTSEC-2026-0194
    (quadratic duplicate-attribute check), both DoS via crafted XML.
- License re-derived over the new vendor tree for the shipped
  targets: no new copyleft linked (new crates are MIT OR
  Apache-2.0); tag unchanged.

